{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "28770a78-b3f5-8eee-82d1-9438f574c6a8",
  "created_at": "2026-01-15T09:06:45-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Erin Reardon",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:04:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:04:31-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good morning. My name is Erin Reardon. I'm calling about some trash that was left out on the curb, a whole pile of it, and it isn't mine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:04:42-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Where is this, Ms. Reardon?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:04:45-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's at 51 Admiral Kalbfus Road, in the North End. The house, it's mine, but the pile, no es mío, sorry. I switch sometimes. It's not mine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:04:56-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No need to apologize at all. So what's in the pile?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:05:01-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A mattress, a broken chair, some boxes, a lamp. The landlord next door, he had a tenant move out last week, and he put everything on the curb. Bulk waste, I guess you call it. It's been there since Saturday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:05:16-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So it's at the neighboring property, but it's sitting on the curb out front of your place, or between the two?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:05:25-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right at the edge, near my driveway. It's blocking where I put my bins. And the wind got into the boxes, so there's paper going in my yard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:05:36-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Typically bulk items need to be arranged ahead of time with the city, and they don't just get picked up on the regular route. So I'll put in a report so someone can look at it and follow up with the owner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:05:52-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's good. I would like a supervisor to call me back, please. I want to hear from a person what is going to happen, porque if it sits there another week, it's too much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:06:05-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can ask a supervisor to call you. What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:06:11-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0155. It's my landline. I'm home most of the day. I paint miniature figures, for a tabletop game, so I am at my table by the window. I'll hear the phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:06:23-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, that's a good spot to be. Let me read it back. Erin Reardon, 51 Admiral Kalbfus Road, bulk waste left by the neighboring landlord after a move-out, supervisor to call 401-555-0155."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:06:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:06:38-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Someone should be in touch. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:06:43-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
